{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Not that one, you have to do the other thing first!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember those games you used to play on the couch with a friend, laughing and shouting side-by-side? Here comes a new challenge that will put your friendship (and your patience) to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle platformer that can only be cleared when two people truly work together. One player flips a switch while the other dashes through the door. One acts as a stepping stone so the other can reach new heights. You'll literally have to work as one to beat these challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strictly for Two!: Every level is meticulously designed for 2-player co-op. Going solo is not an option! (It's also lonely.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Okay to Fail!: Failure is just part of the fun! Instead of blaming your friend, just laugh it off and find a new approach. You're in this together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Game Over!: The only &quot;Game Over&quot; is when one of you decides to &quot;give up&quot; first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your favorite co-op partner and dive into this hilarious adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048740?t=1759070658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048740?t=1759070658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048740/5ebb804b1c2f5a7600043039d1f4bae44501e6d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759070658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048740/5ebb804b1c2f5a7600043039d1f4bae44501e6d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759070658","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Not that one, you have to do the other thing first!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember those games you used to play on the couch with a friend, laughing and shouting side-by-side? Here comes a new challenge that will put your friendship (and your patience) to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle platformer that can only be cleared when two people truly work together. One player flips a switch while the other dashes through the door. One acts as a stepping stone so the other can reach new heights. You'll literally have to work as one to beat these challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strictly for Two!: Every level is meticulously designed for 2-player co-op. Going solo is not an option! (It's also lonely.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Okay to Fail!: Failure is just part of the fun! Instead of blaming your friend, just laugh it off and find a new approach. You're in this together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Game Over!: The only &quot;Game Over&quot; is when one of you decides to &quot;give up&quot; first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your favorite co-op partner and dive into this hilarious adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Quadberos"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048740/c8f47e9aeb881f98f9b044ebff477b889cb42dd5/header.jpg?t=1759070658","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"